<pre>
  <a href="<?php echo SERVER;?>#/search/display/John 5:24-27" target="_blank">John 5:24-27</a>  (He that believeth hath everlasting life)
  <a href="<?php echo SERVER;?>#/search/display/John 6:37-40" target="_blank">John 6:37-40</a>  (All that the Father giveth me shall come to me)
